repository-code: "https://github.com/hixam27/MeToReS"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MeToReS is a Snakemake pipeline for soil and environmental
  metatranscriptomics: per-sample assembly, a pooled non-redundant gene
  catalogue, taxonomic classification, differential expression, functional
  and antimicrobial/metal resistome annotation, and integration with
  environmental chemistry, with built-in safeguards for studies with few
  replicates.
keywords:
  - metatranscriptomics
  - Snakemake
  - pipeline
  - soil
  - resistome
  - environmental chemistry
